1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,731
The third is horizontal, but above the equator, because the yolk below resists the furrow.

2
00:00:06,731 --> 00:00:13,489
So the four cells on top are small micromeres, and the four below are big yolky macromeres.

3
00:00:13,489 --> 00:00:19,492
The cleavage cuts right through the egg, so it is holoblastic, but the cells are unequal.

